"[are you in debt|do you owe anyone money|do you owe money to anyone|do you owe money]"
( prob { ?_you /pres owe ? } )
.
"[who do you owe money to|to whom are you indebted|whom do you owe money to]"
( o /known { ?_you /pres owe @o } )
.
"do you owe $person(Q_NP) money"
